37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The statements show February was 29,400 yen, but August was only 9,100.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The electrician quoted 34,000 yen per room. That’s a huge upfront cost.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,The kitchen notice showed people avoiding the cooler to avoid arguments.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, 34,000 yen per room is steep. Is it worth it for fairness?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Jonathan, the seasonal swing is massive. A flat rate won’t work.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, if we meter, we need to handle the shared areas too.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,I can’t justify the upfront cost without seeing a clear long-term saving.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,I worry that metering will make us feel like strangers in our own home.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The sunlight data shows two rooms need heat from November. That’s a big factor.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,The other house spent forty minutes just logging readings. I don’t have that time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The payment log shows three late payments in the last year. Trust is low.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"If we go seasonal, we need a fixed rate that covers the worst month.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think we need a system that doesn’t require constant negotiation.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m leaning towards per-room metering, but the cost is a barrier.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,I prefer a seasonal fixed rate if we can agree on the numbers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I’m open to either, but we need to address the shared area costs.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I need to see the options clearly before I can decide.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,I just want us to get along. Let’s pick something simple.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
